              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani anini waan galaana dawiti fakaata arge; ka ibidaani wolkeesa jiru Anini ammalle worra bineensafi akheekha isaatiifi nama maqaani isa lamba fakaatu dabsate arge. Worri fulla galaana dawiti fakaatu ejaanje kiraari Waaqi worra kenne harka qabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
